WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.336
Money skills start with everyday choices.

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:03.534
Make them an adventure.

00:00:04.347 --> 00:00:06.092
Create a practice wallet, choose a

00:00:06.092 --> 00:00:08.740
companion, and give your learner fictional Brotes.

00:00:09.947 --> 00:00:11.329
Set a goal and save toward

00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:12.975
it. See each small step add up.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:17.298
Compare prices in Market Adventure. Build an emergency reserve

00:00:17.298 --> 00:00:20.153
in Goal Island. Earn practice rewards when you finish.

00:00:22.247 --> 00:00:24.914
Practice a purchase. Review requests, approve

00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:27.581
spending, and follow each learner's activity.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.519
Choose Mainnet or Testnet. Guardian signatures authorize transfers. Here

00:00:32.519 --> 00:00:36.012
are earlier testnet transactions verified in Solana Explorer.

00:00:36.813 --> 00:00:40.405
Save a backup, explore demo perspectives, and use simple

00:00:40.405 --> 00:00:43.847
mode. Brote speaks English, Spanish, and Portuguese.

00:00:44.647 --> 00:00:48.350
Open Brote. Start with practice. Grow your confidence together.
